+## Cut list (drop from the top when behind)
+
+| # | Cut | Saves | Consequence |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Badges | 2–3h | None for demo |
+| 2 | Platinum in UI (keep in schema/feed) | 3–4h | "Gold today, platinum next" is a fine demo line |
+| 3 | 3D → 2D animated stack | 0.5–1d | Still looks good; fallback is pre-planned |
+| 4 | Delivery request flow | 2–3h | Mention verbally; form is trivial post-demo |
+| 5 | Price alerts | 2h | AI chat still shows price awareness |
+| 6 | Passkey login (keep password) | 3h | Biometric story told, not shown |
+| 7 | Compliance rules beyond 500k-review + manual freeze | 3–4h | Freeze demo still works |
+| 8 | KYC review queue → auto-approve with stored docs | 2h | Flow still demonstrable |
+
+**Never cut:** ledger correctness · reserve gate · quote expiry · audit log. These four are what make it a financial platform instead of a mockup — and they're exactly what a partner bank will probe.
+
+## Standing risks this plan absorbs
+
+- **Client scope-push before demo** (lending, dashboards, more providers): answer stays "yes, separately quoted, and it moves the 13th" (spec §14).
+- **Payment calendar is stale**: spec tied payments to calendar dates now passed; this plan re-anchors them to phases 2/4/7 — flag to client for written acknowledgment.
+- **Blocking answers**: 24h rule (spec assumption 6) — escalate same-day via Goitom.
+- **Free-feed outage on stage**: dual price sources + seeded ticks mean the demo never shows an empty chart.